"Drusi-otta, called Drusi, is Lind-otta's cousin and votary."
"After the flood Drusi was stationed unseen at CNH's Celena Circle to watch over Alden."
"Drusi guards Alden against approaching Artonans such as Bash-nor, and prizes staying in shadow."
"Drusi told Alden: I will watch over you in my own way. Live as though I do not."
"Alden suspects votary means assassin."
